abstract: >
  AI Travel Benchmark is an open-source, provider-independent framework
  for the automated comparative evaluation of AI-generated travel plans.
  The framework applies standardized input conditions, structured JSON
  response processing, field-level comparison, deterministic scoring,
  and automatic ranking across heterogeneous large language models.